{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/0b6e7292fb8b7ba240b6ca9125c89b1a.avif?t=1768376870\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Grind, Loot, Die\u00a0\u2014 and Repeat!\u00a0</strong>Confront hordes of monsters and challenging boss fights in a 2.5D class-based roguelike RPG where you can be a Warrior, Merchant, Alchemist \u2014 or even a Cat \ud83d\udc08.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.poster.avif?t=1768376870\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.webm?t=1768376870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/1e8cadb56babe200a64bb241f21735ff.mp4?t=1768376870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/00da46912302833057255227cc626891.avif?t=1768376870\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/56ac692b872524ad90bc2c78b12130c3.avif?t=1768376870\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf92 Loot, loot, and more LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 80+ items for you to discover, each piece you collect and how you combine them, opens up fresh strategies\u2014and unlocks even more loot in return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Mix &amp; Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a Warrior who slings potions like an Alchemist? Or a Wizard with the street smarts of a Merchant? Master your skills, then mix and match to build your own wild playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Hiring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your death was not in vain. Other players can hire your ghost characters, and you will be rewarded with special currency to upgrade your next run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Online Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your score and compete against other players globally in real-time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u269c\ufe0f Rebuild Your Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue guild members to expand your base, unlock new features like Boss Card, Exploration, discover new zones, items, and characters, and many more for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/85b43493a9ec50ce5894b81450a68396.avif?t=1768376870\" width=600 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e9b77.poster.avif?t=1768376870\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e9b77.webm?t=1768376870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/faf11cb2639ca722bb176f22348e