 Die\u2014and repeat! Face hordes of monsters and challenging bosses in a 2.5D pixel roguelike RPG where you can mix and match skills across classes. Be a potion-brewing Warrior or a Firebolt-casting Cat, the choice is yours! \ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udd25","steam_appid":3792120,"support_info":{"email":"contact@roguesodyssey.com","url":"https://roguesodyssey.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"http://roguesodyssey.com/"}